WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.490
On 12 December 2022,
Azerbaijani protesters,

2
00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.910
widely seen as backed
by their government,

3
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.890
blocked the Lachin corridor,

4
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.914
the only road
from Artsakh to Armenia.

5
00:00:14.954 --> 00:00:18.148
Some 120,000 people were cut off.

6
00:00:18.508 --> 00:00:22.150
From mid-June, even Red Cross
deliveries were stopped.

7
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.600
Food, medicine and fuel ran short,

8
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.555
and families queued for bread.

9
00:00:26.915 --> 00:00:31.145
In February 2023,
the International Court of Justice

10
00:00:31.185 --> 00:00:34.425
ordered Azerbaijan
to ensure unimpeded movement

11
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:35.885
along the corridor,

12
00:00:35.925 --> 00:00:38.220
but the road stayed closed.

13
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:42.110
On 19 September, Azerbaijan
opened an offensive,

14
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.241
and a ceasefire the next day
ended Artsakh's defense.

15
00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:50.371
Almost the whole population
took the open corridor to Armenia,

16
00:00:50.411 --> 00:00:53.056
in cars, trucks and buses.

17
00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:54.803
Endure, defender.

18
00:00:54.843 --> 00:00:58.682
Carry the people and their memory
out of the valley.

